1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:04,110
Hello guys, welcome back to our YouTube channel Safety Management Study
大家好，欢迎回到我们的 YouTube 频道 Safety Management Study。

2
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:10,110
In today's video, we will learn how to apply for a safety officer in a company
在今天的视频中，我们将了解如何应聘公司的安全员。

3
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:22,110
When we give an interview, we will learn about the questions related to the confined space
在面试时，我们会了解与受限空间相关的问题。

4
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:32,350
In the interview, we can ask you what is confined space
面试时可能会问你什么是受限空间。

5
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:35,350
You have to answer this question from point to point
这个问题你要逐点回答。

6
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:39,350
You can say, space having limited access and aggression
你可以说：进出途径有限的空间。

7
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:46,350
Any space where there is a narrow path and a narrow path is partially enclosed
任何通道狭窄、并且部分封闭的空间。

8
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:50,350
Then you can say, space that is not designed for human occupancy
然后你可以说：不是为人员长期占用而设计的空间。

9
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:54,350
Any space that is not designed for human occupancy
任何不是为人员长期占用而设计的空间。

10
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:56,350
That is, it is not designed for us to live
也就是说，它不是为我们居住而设计的，

11
00:00:56,350 --> 00:00:58,350
No one can live in it
没有人能在里面长住。

12
00:00:58,350 --> 00:01:03,350
First you can say, space having oxygen deficiency and oxygen enrichment
首先你可以说：存在缺氧和富氧的空间。

13
00:01:03,350 --> 00:01:09,350
That is, any space where oxygen is less or oxygen is more
也就是说，任何氧气偏少或氧气偏多的空间。

14
00:01:09,350 --> 00:01:14,350
Next you can say, space having risk of flammable gas or vapor accumulation
接下来你可以说：存在易燃气体或蒸气积聚风险的空间。

15
00:01:14,350 --> 00:01:20,350
That is, any space where flammable gas or vapor can accumulate
也就是说，任何易燃气体或蒸气可能积聚的空间。

16
00:01:20,350 --> 00:01:25,350
If any hot work is going on, any chemical or welding is going on
如果正在进行动火作业，正在使用化学品或进行焊接，

17
00:01:25,350 --> 00:01:28,350
Any chemical or flammable gas is going on
正在使用任何化学品或易燃气体，

18
00:01:28,350 --> 00:01:30,350
They can be gathered there
它们就可能在那里积聚。

19
00:01:30,350 --> 00:01:32,350
That is, no one can take them out
也就是说，没有办法把它们排出去。

20
00:01:32,350 --> 00:01:36,350
If there is such a condition in any space, then we will say confined space
如果某个空间存在这样的状况，我们就称之为受限空间。

21
00:01:36,350 --> 00:01:39,350
The second question you can ask
可能会问你的第二个问题是：

22
00:01:39,350 --> 00:01:41,350
What are the hazards in confined space?
受限空间内有哪些危害？

23
00:01:41,350 --> 00:01:44,350
What are the hazards present in confined space?
受限空间内存在哪些危害？

24
00:01:44,350 --> 00:01:48,350
First you can say, presence of toxic and flammable gases
首先你可以说：存在有毒和易燃气体。

25
00:01:48,350 --> 00:01:51,350
That is, toxic and flammable gases can be present
也就是说，可能存在有毒和易燃气体。

26
00:01:51,350 --> 00:01:53,350
Fire and explosion can happen
可能发生火灾和爆炸。

27
00:01:53,350 --> 00:01:57,350
Poor ventilation, that is, no air is supplied in it
通风不良，也就是里面没有空气供应。

28
00:01:57,350 --> 00:02:01,350
If there is no way to get fresh air, then you can say poor ventilation
如果没有新鲜空气进入的途径，你就可以说通风不良。

29
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:04,350
You can say poor illumination, that is, light
你可以说照明不良，也就是光线。

30
00:02:04,350 --> 00:02:07,350
That is, there is no facility for light, no place for light entry
也就是说，没有照明设施，没有光线进入的地方。

31
00:02:07,350 --> 00:02:09,350
So this is your hazard
所以这就是你的危害。

32
00:02:09,350 --> 00:02:11,350
Next you have oxygen deficiency
接下来是缺氧。

33
00:02:11,350 --> 00:02:13,350
That is, the lack of oxygen
也就是氧气不足。

34
00:02:13,350 --> 00:02:15,350
We will say the lack of oxygen
我们会说氧气不足。

35
00:02:15,350 --> 00:02:18,350
When you have oxygen in the environment below 90.5%
当环境中的氧气低于 90.5% 时，

36
00:02:18,350 --> 00:02:22,350
You will say oxygen level, that is, oxygen deficiency
你就会说氧含量……也就是缺氧。

37
00:02:22,350 --> 00:02:24,350
Next is oxygen enrichment
接下来是富氧。

38
00:02:24,350 --> 00:02:27,350
That is, oxygen enrichment means more oxygen
也就是说，富氧是指氧气偏多。

39
00:02:27,350 --> 00:02:29,350
So when will this happen?
那么什么时候会出现这种情况呢？

40
00:02:29,350 --> 00:02:32,350
When you have oxygen in the atmosphere above 23.5%
当大气中的氧气高于 23.5% 时，

41
00:02:32,350 --> 00:02:34,350
You will say oxygen enrichment
你就会说富氧。

42
00:02:34,350 --> 00:02:37,350
Next is improper access and aggression
接下来是进出通道不当。

43
00:02:37,350 --> 00:02:39,350
That is, if the road is not right
也就是说，通道不合适。

44
00:02:39,350 --> 00:02:41,350
Next is extreme temperature
接下来是极端温度。

45
00:02:41,350 --> 00:02:43,350
That is, more temperature is present there
也就是说，那里的温度过高。

46
00:02:43,350 --> 00:02:45,350
So these are hazards, there are many other hazards
这些都是危害，还有很多其他危害。

47
00:02:45,350 --> 00:02:47,350
As it will increase your work
随着你的工作量增加，

48
00:02:47,350 --> 00:02:49,350
That way your hazards will also increase
你面临的危害也会相应增加。

49
00:02:49,350 --> 00:02:51,350
Next question can be
下一个问题可能是：

50
00:02:51,350 --> 00:02:54,350
What are the precautions to be taken for confined space?
受限空间作业需要采取哪些防范措施？

51
00:02:54,350 --> 00:02:56,350
That is, whenever you are working in confined space
也就是说，每当你在受限空间内作业时，

52
00:02:56,350 --> 00:02:58,350
What are the precautions you have to take?
你需要采取哪些防范措施？

53
00:02:58,350 --> 00:03:01,350
So the first is PTW, that is, Permit to Work
第一是 PTW，也就是工作许可证。

54
00:03:01,350 --> 00:03:03,350
Whenever any work is starting,
每当开始任何工作时，

55
00:03:03,350 --> 00:03:05,350
That confined space or excavation
无论是受限空间作业还是开挖作业，

56
00:03:05,350 --> 00:03:06,350
Or any other job
或任何其他作业，

57
00:03:06,350 --> 00:03:08,350
First of all, you have to issue a permit
首先你都要签发许可证，

58
00:03:08,350 --> 00:03:10,350
You have to receive a permit
你要领取许可证。

59
00:03:10,350 --> 00:03:13,350
Next is your confined space entry training
接下来是受限空间进入培训。

60
00:03:13,350 --> 00:03:16,350
Whatever workers and staff are working in confined space
所有在受限空间内工作的工人和员工，

61
00:03:16,350 --> 00:03:19,350
All of them should have confined space entry training
都应该接受过受限空间进入培训。

62
00:03:19,350 --> 00:03:22,350
Next is gas testing before starting the work
接下来是开始作业前

63
00:03:22,350 --> 00:03:24,350
by authorized gas tester
由授权的气体检测员进行气体检测。

64
00:03:24,350 --> 00:03:27,350
That is, you have to get the gas testing done
也就是说，你必须在作业开始前

65
00:03:27,350 --> 00:03:29,350
before the work begins
完成气体检测。

66
00:03:29,350 --> 00:03:31,350
Next is appointment of a whole watcher
接下来是指派一名进出口监护人，

67
00:03:31,350 --> 00:03:33,350
with entry exit lock seat
并配备进出记录表。

68
00:03:33,350 --> 00:03:35,350
Whatever is your whole watcher
你的进出口监护人

69
00:03:35,350 --> 00:03:36,350
you have to appoint it
要事先指派好，

70
00:03:36,350 --> 00:03:38,350
and it should have a lock seat
而且他要有一份记录表，

71
00:03:38,350 --> 00:03:41,350
in which your entry exit details should be mentioned
上面记录进出的详细信息。

72
00:03:41,350 --> 00:03:44,350
Next is regular communication with the entrants
接下来是与进入人员保持定期联络。

73
00:03:44,350 --> 00:03:46,350
Whatever is going inside your entrants
对于进入里面的人员，

74
00:03:46,350 --> 00:03:49,350
should be your regular communication
你要与他们保持定期联络。

75
00:03:49,350 --> 00:03:51,350
Next is proper ventilation
接下来是适当的通风。

76
00:03:51,350 --> 00:03:54,350
That is, there should be proper ventilation in confined space
也就是说，受限空间内应有适当的通风。

77
00:03:54,350 --> 00:03:56,350
Next is proper illumination
接下来是适当的照明。

78
00:03:56,350 --> 00:03:58,350
That is, there should be proper lighting
也就是说，应有适当的照明。

79
00:03:58,350 --> 00:03:59,350
And the illumination you will give
你提供的照明

80
00:03:59,350 --> 00:04:01,350
will be your 24V lamp
要用 24 伏的灯。

81
00:04:01,350 --> 00:04:03,350
That is, what we generally use 240V
也就是我们平时一般用的 240 伏，

82
00:04:03,350 --> 00:04:05,350
You don't have to use it
你不能用。

83
00:04:05,350 --> 00:04:07,350
You have to use 24V
你要用 24 伏。

84
00:04:07,350 --> 00:04:10,350
Because there will be very less chances of fire spark
因为这样产生火花引发火灾的可能性会非常小。

85
00:04:10,350 --> 00:04:13,350
That is why you have to use 24V only
这就是为什么你只能用 24 伏。

86
00:04:13,350 --> 00:04:16,350
Next is proper access and aggression
接下来是适当的进出通道。

87
00:04:16,350 --> 00:04:19,350
You should have proper access and aggression there
那里应该有合适的进出通道。

88
00:04:19,350 --> 00:04:22,350
Next is knowledge of emergency rescue plan
接下来是了解应急救援计划。

89
00:04:22,350 --> 00:04:24,350
Whatever staff and workers are working there
所有在那里工作的员工和工人，

90
00:04:24,350 --> 00:04:26,350
They should know that
都应该知道：

91
00:04:26,350 --> 00:04:28,350
You have to face the emergency
如果遇到紧急情况，

92
00:04:28,350 --> 00:04:30,350
So how to rescue you?
怎样救援你？

93
00:04:30,350 --> 00:04:31,350
What to do after that?
之后该怎么做？

94
00:04:31,350 --> 00:04:34,350
You should have emergency rescue equipment
你应该配备应急救援设备，

95
00:04:34,350 --> 00:04:37,350
For example, your stretcher, harness, crane
例如担架、安全带、起重设备、

96
00:04:37,350 --> 00:04:39,350
Tripod, Scaba, first aid kit
三脚架、SCBA、急救箱，

97
00:04:39,350 --> 00:04:42,350
All these equipment should be available on your site
所有这些设备都应该在现场备好。

98
00:04:42,350 --> 00:04:44,350
Next question is
下一个问题是：

99
00:04:44,350 --> 00:04:46,350
Who is a confined space attendant?
谁是受限空间监护人？

100
00:04:46,350 --> 00:04:48,350
That is, who is a confined space attendant?
也就是说，受限空间监护人是谁？

101
00:04:48,350 --> 00:04:50,350
So a confined space attendant
受限空间监护人

102
00:04:50,350 --> 00:04:53,350
is one who is aware of confined space hazards
是了解受限空间危害的人。

103
00:04:53,350 --> 00:04:55,350
That is, any person
也就是说，任何人

104
00:04:55,350 --> 00:04:58,350
who knows about the hazards of a confined space
只要了解受限空间的危害，

105
00:04:58,350 --> 00:05:00,350
and knows that whenever something is wrong
并且知道每当出了问题时

106
00:05:00,350 --> 00:05:02,350
then how to react
该如何应对，

107
00:05:02,350 --> 00:05:04,350
Then we will say a confined space attendant
我们就称他为受限空间监护人。

108
00:05:04,350 --> 00:05:06,350
And it also has a log sheet
他还会有一份记录表，

109
00:05:06,350 --> 00:05:08,350
in which the detail of the entry and exit is mentioned
上面记录进出的详细信息。

110
00:05:08,350 --> 00:05:11,350
An interviewer can ask you an example of a confined space
面试官可能会让你举一个受限空间的例子。

111
00:05:11,350 --> 00:05:13,350
So you have to tell you
那你就要告诉他：

112
00:05:13,350 --> 00:05:15,350
Pipes, vessel, tanks, siloes, ducts
管道、容器、储罐、筒仓、风管，

113
00:05:15,350 --> 00:05:17,350
Excavation is more than 1.2 meters etc
深度超过 1.2 米的基坑等。

114
00:05:17,350 --> 00:05:19,350
Next question can be asked
下一个可能会问的问题是：

115
00:05:19,350 --> 00:05:21,350
Why what is hot work?
什么是动火作业？

116
00:05:21,350 --> 00:05:22,350
What is hot work?
什么是动火作业？

117
