So you can say that the hot work process
你可以说，动火作业是指

118
00:05:24,350 --> 00:05:26,350
that can be a source of ignition
可能成为点火源的作业过程，

119
00:05:26,350 --> 00:05:28,350
Such as welding, cutting, grinding etc
比如焊接、切割、打磨等。

120
00:05:28,350 --> 00:05:30,350
So how is the hot work process
所以动火作业就是

121
00:05:30,350 --> 00:05:32,350
that can be a source of ignition
可能成为点火源的作业过程，

122
00:05:32,350 --> 00:05:34,350
that can be a source of ignition
可能成为点火源，

123
00:05:34,350 --> 00:05:36,350
that can be a source of ignition
可能成为点火源，

124
00:05:36,350 --> 00:05:38,350
that can be a source of ignition
可能成为点火源，

125
00:05:38,350 --> 00:05:40,350
such as welding, cutting, grinding etc
比如焊接、切割、打磨等。

126
