Next question can be asked
下一个可能会问的问题是：

137
00:06:02,350 --> 00:06:04,350
What is your different type of respirators?
呼吸器有哪些不同类型？

138
00:06:04,350 --> 00:06:06,350
So you have to answer
你要这样回答：

139
00:06:06,350 --> 00:06:08,350
Air purifier respirators
空气净化式呼吸器，

140
00:06:08,350 --> 00:06:10,350
And second is supplied air respirators
第二种是供气式呼吸器。

141
00:06:10,350 --> 00:06:12,350
Air purifier purifies you
空气净化式呼吸器直接

142
00:06:12,350 --> 00:06:14,350
