从大气中为你净化空气

143
00:06:14,350 --> 00:06:16,350
and supplies you
并供给你。

144
00:06:16,350 --> 00:06:18,350
What is supplied air respirator?
什么是供气式呼吸器？

145
00:06:18,350 --> 00:06:20,350
You have a separate air cylinder
你有一个单独的气瓶，

146
00:06:20,350 --> 00:06:22,350
with which your compressed gas
里面是压缩气体，

147
00:06:22,350 --> 00:06:24,350
