underwater breathing apparatus
水下呼吸器。

158
00:06:44,350 --> 00:06:46,350
SCABA is heavy
SCBA 很重。

159
00:06:46,350 --> 00:06:48,350
SCABA is heavy
SCBA 很重。

160
00:06:48,350 --> 00:06:50,350
So what is the difference between these two
那么这两者有什么区别呢？

161
00:06:50,350 --> 00:06:52,350
SCUBA is underwater
SCUBA 是水下用的，

162
00:06:52,350 --> 00:06:54,350
which is used in water
是在水中使用的；

163
00:06:54,350 --> 00:06:56,350
SCABA is used above water surface
SCBA 在水面以上使用。

164
00:06:56,350 --> 00:06:58,350
SCUBA is heavier
SCUBA 比

165
00:06:58,350 --> 00:07:00,350
than SCABA
SCBA 更重。

166
00:07:00,350 --> 00:07:02,350
SCABA helps you
SCBA 帮助你

167
00:07:02,350 --> 00:07:04,350
to enter the water
进入水中，

168
00:07:04,350 --> 00:07:06,350
This is why you can enter the water depth
所以你可以进入一定的水深。

169
00:07:06,350 --> 00:07:08,350
There are other similar things
还有其他一些相似之处，

170
