There is a difference
也有一个区别：

171
00:07:10,350 --> 00:07:12,350
SCABA is used above water surface
SCBA 在水面以上使用，

172
00:07:12,350 --> 00:07:14,350
SCUBA is used under water
SCUBA 在水下使用。

173
00:07:14,350 --> 00:07:16,350
Before going forward
在继续之前，

174
00:07:16,350 --> 00:07:18,350
Before going forward
在继续之前，

175
